    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The National Accreditation Council for Teacher Education (NACTE), a prestigious division of the Higher Education Commission, has awarded the highest 'W' category accreditation to the Aga Khan University Institute for Educational Development's (AKU-IED) Master of Education (MEd) degree programme. The MEd programme is the first and only master's level programme to receive such a ranking in the country.",
